  <strong> How to Reach Warangal</strong>
<p>
    <b>By Air:
      </b>The nearest Airport is <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/hyderabad.aspx" target="_blank">Hyderabad </a>(140-km) connected by Indian Airlines flights with Bombay, Bangalore, Bhubaneshwar, Calcutta, Delhi, Madras, Nagpur, and Vishakhapatnam. Continental Aviation also operates flights from Hyderabad to Bombay.
    
</p>
    <p>

        <b>By Rail :</b>
      Warangal is linked to <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/top-cities.aspx" target="_blank"> all-important cities </a>in India by rail.
    
</p>
    <p>
        <b>By Road :</b>
      Regular bus services are available (APSRTC) from <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/hyderabad.aspx" target="_blank">Hyderabad</a>, Yadagirigutta, <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/vijaywada.aspx" target="_blank">Vijayawada</a>, Armur, Kolanupaka, Jangaon, Kodad, Karimnagar, Nizamabad, Adilabad, Suryapet, Palampet, Jagtial, Khammam, Bhadrachalam, Basara, <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Karnataka-Destinations/Bangalore.aspx" target="_blank">Bangalore</a>, <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/Karnataka-Destinations/mysore.aspx" target="_blank">Mysore and <a href="https://www.indiacitytrip.com/andhra-Pradesh-Destinations/tirupati.aspx" target="_blank">Tirupati</a>.

</p>
    <p>
        <b>Local Transport :</b>

      Coaches are available from the Depot Manager, New Bus Depot, Andhra Pradesh State Road Transport Corporation, Hanamakonda.

</p>
                        
